{"id": "47301", "title": "狼毒花", "author": "张晓亚", "category": "历史军事", "count": 45, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/47/47301/47301s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47301.htm", "intro": "本书以潇洒奔放的笔墨浓缩了常发在抗日战争、解放战争、赤峰剿匪等近十年的最为传奇的人生故事。这个十二岁杀人越狱、十八岁占山为王、二十岁就当了“司令”的乱世英雄在抗日战争最为艰苦的岁月里毅然投奔了八路军，开始了自己真正的英雄历程。而在八路军中他只是一个普通到不能再普通的警卫员。他有超人的胆略和大智若愚的聪慧，也有放荡不羁，却又铭心刻骨的感情纠葛；他有出生入死的豪情壮举，也有儿女情长的尴尬和窘迫；他杀死了无数的鬼子、汉奸、土匪、草寇，也杀死了自己最心爱的女人……", "base": "files/article/html/47/47301", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节", "file": "6405724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "6405725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节", "file": "6405726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节", "file": "6405727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节", "file": "6405728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节", "file": "6405729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节", "file": "6405730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八节", "file": "6405731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九节", "file": "6405732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十节", "file": "6405733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一节", "file": "6405734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二节", "file": "6405735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三节", "file": "6405736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四节", "file": "6405737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五节", "file": "6405738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十六节", "file": "6405740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七节", "file": "6405741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八节", "file": "6405742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九节", "file": "6405743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十节", "file": "6405744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一节", "file": "6405745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二节", "file": "6405746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三节", "file": "6405747.html", "